    ],
    "component": "DateRangePicker",
    "field_category": "Props",
    "field_name": "cancelRangeSelectLimit",
    "field_type": [
      "Boolean"
    ],
    "field_default_value": "false",
    "field_desc_zh": "默认的日期选择交互是根据点击前后日期的顺序来决定并且会加以限制。比如：用户先点击开始时间输入框，选择了一个日期例如2020-05-15，紧接着交互会自动将焦点跳到结束日期输入框，等待用户选择结束时间。此时用户只能选择大于2020-05-15的日期（之前的日期会被灰态禁止点击，限制用户的点击）。当该值传递`true`时，则取消该限制",
    "field_desc_en": "The default date selection interaction is determined based on the order of dates clicked and will be restricted. For example, if a user first clicks on the start date input box and chooses a date, for instance, 2020-05-15, the interaction will automatically shift focus to the end date input box, waiting for the user to select the end time. At this point, the user can only select a date later than 2020-05-15 (previous dates will be grayed out and disabled, restricting the user's selection). When this value is set to `true`, this restriction is lifted"
  },
